unofficial-ercot-mms-skin
Copyright 2026 Wattness

This project is an independent, unofficial recreation of the visual style of
the Market Management System (MMS) screens operated by the Electric
Reliability Council of Texas, Inc. (ERCOT). It is not ERCOT software and is
not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by ERCOT. The name "ERCOT" is
used only to describe what the style recreates; ERCOT's names and marks belong
to ERCOT.

Third-party material

None is included. The repository contains no ERCOT images, logos, documents,
schemas, code or fonts. Ten values in src/tokens.css were measured from a
screenshot in a public ERCOT presentation:

  ERCOT-TWG-2026-08-20-NPRR-1188-System-Impacts.pptx, ppt/media/image11.png
  https://www.ercot.com/files/docs/2026/08/20/ERCOT-TWG-2026-08-20-NPRR-1188-System-Impacts.pptx

scripts/verify-provenance.mjs downloads that file when run, to check the
values, and does not store or redistribute it.

Fonts

No font files are bundled. The stylesheet names fonts installed with common
operating systems (Verdana, Tahoma, Geneva, Georgia, Menlo, Consolas) and
generic CSS families (ui-monospace, monospace, sans-serif, serif). Fonts are
loaded from the user's system under their owners' licences.
